WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
We should check the weather before leaving home.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.200
Please keep the window open for fresh air.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.200
The little shop closes at six every evening.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.200
My sister usually takes the early morning train.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.200
Could you show me the nearest bus stop?

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.200
They are waiting beside the old stone bridge.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.200
I left my blue notebook on the kitchen table.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.200
This quiet street becomes busy after the school bell.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.200
We can meet outside the library tomorrow afternoon.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.200
The coffee tastes better with a little warm milk.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.200
Please remember to bring your reusable shopping bag.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.200
Our new neighbors moved here last Saturday morning.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.200
She reads a short story before going to sleep.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.200
The museum offers free entry on the first Sunday.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.200
I will call you when the meeting is over.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.200
He found a useful map inside the travel guide.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.200
The children planted small flowers near the front gate.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.200
We need another minute to finish this careful review.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.200
A gentle breeze came through the open balcony door.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.200
Please write your address clearly on the yellow envelope.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.200
The local market sells fresh fruit every Thursday morning.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.200
Could we sit somewhere away from the busy entrance?

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.200
My brother learned these useful phrases during his trip.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.200
The blue bus arrives here every twenty minutes.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.200
I prefer walking when the weather is mild and sunny.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.200
Our teacher shared a helpful example with the class.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.200
The new bakery makes warm bread before sunrise.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.200
Please turn left after the small green pharmacy.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.200
We saved enough time to visit the bookshop nearby.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.200
Her careful notes helped everyone understand the instructions.
